flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3733243Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3734105Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3734571Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3734968Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3736530Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3737343Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3737632Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3738108Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3738355Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3738791Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3739455Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3740291Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3740768Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3740971Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3741278Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3741617Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3741865Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3742326Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3742485Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3742622Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3742818Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3743149Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
