flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3745888Z I will:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3748247Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3749090Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3749603Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3750414Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
