flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3751184Z  - install Nix in /nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3751486Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-12T15:21:41.3751928Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
